    {"type":"text","id":"event_wait_text","x":1110,"y":1525,"width":350,"height":110,"text":"FAILED / 等待真实生命周期事件\n\nBluetooth matching callback\nReceiver 0x10 / 0x41 link-up\n用户重新打开窗口或手动重试\n\n不做无限轮询","originalText":"FAILED / 等待真实生命周期事件\n\nBluetooth matching callback\nReceiver 0x10 / 0x41 link-up\n用户重新打开窗口或手动重试\n\n不做无限轮询","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30221,"version":1,"versionNonce":30222,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
