    {"type":"rectangle","id":"code_evidence","x":85,"y":1800,"width":780,"height":250,"strokeColor":"#1e293b","backgroundColor":"#1e293b","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30305,"version":1,"versionNonce":30306,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"code_evidence_text","x":115,"y":1825,"width":720,"height":200,"text":"// App lifecycle\nNSWorkspace.willSleepNotification  -> prepareForSystemSleep()\nNSWorkspace.didWakeNotification    -> recoverAfterSystemWake()\n\n// 必须拆分现有 stop()\nstopAndRestoreHardware()      // 用户关闭 / Command-Q\nsuspendWithoutRestoring()    // 系统睡眠，不阻塞\n\n// 旧代际回调直接丢弃\nguard callback.generation == currentGeneration else { return }","originalText":"// App lifecycle\nNSWorkspace.willSleepNotification  -> prepareForSystemSleep()\nNSWorkspace.didWakeNotification    -> recoverAfterSystemWake()\n\n// 必须拆分现有 stop()\nstopAndRestoreHardware()      // 用户关闭 / Command-Q\nsuspendWithoutRestoring()    // 系统睡眠，不阻塞\n\n// 旧代际回调直接丢弃\nguard callback.generation == currentGeneration else { return }","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#22c55e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30307,"version":1,"versionNonce":30308,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"invariants","x":920,"y":1800,"width":790,"height":250,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30309,"version":1,"versionNonce":30310,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"invariants_text","x":950,"y":1825,"width":730,"height":200,"text":"恢复完成的四条不变量\n\n1. 用户意图 takeoverRequested 未被睡眠清除\n2. 旧 IOHIDDevice、deviceKey、slot、feature index 全部失效\n3. 只有 SetMode 成功且 GetMode 回读一致，才恢复 verifiedTakeoverAxes\n4. 未验证时 CGEvent 抑制始终 fail-open，原生滚动保持可用\n\n附加恢复：重新枚举 DeviceConnectionMonitor、重新启用 CGEvent tap、刷新电量与 UI","originalText":"恢复完成的四条不变量\n\n1. 用户意图 takeoverRequested 未被睡眠清除\n2. 旧 IOHIDDevice、deviceKey、slot、feature index 全部失效\n3. 只有 SetMode 成功且 GetMode 回读一致，才恢复 verifiedTakeoverAxes\n4. 未验证时 CGEvent 抑制始终 fail-open，原生滚动保持可用\n\n附加恢复：重新枚举 DeviceConnectionMonitor、重新启用 CGEvent tap、刷新电量与 UI","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30311,"version":1,"versionNonce":30312,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"line","id":"divider_four","x":80,"y":2110,"width":1630,"height":0,"strokeColor":"#93c5fd","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40001,"version":1,"versionNonce":40002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[1630,0]]},
    {"type":"text","id":"all_events_heading","x":80,"y":2140,"width":1000,"height":34,"text":"5. 所有事件监听入口与恢复动作映射","originalText":"5. 所有事件监听入口与恢复动作映射","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40003,"version":1,"versionNonce":40004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"all_events_subtitle","x":82,"y":2182,"width":1450,"height":24,"text":"事件先进入各自监听器，再归一化为少数动作；不要让 UI 连接状态、滚动数据和硬件接管状态互相代替","originalText":"事件先进入各自监听器，再归一化为少数动作；不要让 UI 连接状态、滚动数据和硬件接管状态互相代替","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40005,"version":1,"versionNonce":40006,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"system_events_group","x":80,"y":2250,"width":470,"height":280,"strokeColor":"#c2410c","backgroundColor":"#fed7aa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40101,"version":1,"versionNonce":40102,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"system_events_text","x":105,"y":2270,"width":420,"height":240,"text":"A. App / 系统电源生命周期\n\napplicationDidFinishLaunching\n  -> startAutomatically()：启动全部监听\n\nNSWorkspace.willSleepNotification\n  -> SUSPEND：立即失效 verified axes + 释放 HID\n\nNSWorkspace.didWakeNotification\n  -> FULL_REBUILD：延迟后重建全部监听\n\napplicationWillTerminate\n  -> RESTORE_AND_STOP：同步恢复硬件后退出","originalText":"A. App / 系统电源生命周期\n\napplicationDidFinishLaunching\n  -> startAutomatically()：启动全部监听\n\nNSWorkspace.willSleepNotification\n  -> SUSPEND：立即失效 verified axes + 释放 HID\n\nNSWorkspace.didWakeNotification\n  -> FULL_REBUILD：延迟后重建全部监听\n\napplicationWillTerminate\n  -> RESTORE_AND_STOP：同步恢复硬件后退出","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40103,"version":1,"versionNonce":40104,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"ui_events_group","x":80,"y":2570,"width":470,"height":260,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"#93c5fd","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40105,"version":1,"versionNonce":40106,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"ui_events_text","x":105,"y":2590,"width":420,"height":220,"text":"B. 用户 / 窗口事件\n\n平滑滚动开关 ON\n  -> TAKEOVER：发现 feature、SetMode、回读\n\n平滑滚动开关 OFF\n  -> RESTORE：写回接管前模式并回读\n\nshowWindow / reopen\n  -> VERIFY：校验模式；无 active route 时触发 reacquire\n  -> refreshBattery()\n\n方向切换 -> 只重置模型，不重建设备","originalText":"B. 用户 / 窗口事件\n\n平滑滚动开关 ON\n  -> TAKEOVER：发现 feature、SetMode、回读\n\n平滑滚动开关 OFF\n  -> RESTORE：写回接管前模式并回读\n\nshowWindow / reopen\n  -> VERIFY：校验模式；无 active route 时触发 reacquire\n  -> refreshBattery()\n\n方向切换 -> 只重置模型，不重建设备","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40107,"version":1,"versionNonce":40108,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"registry_events_group","x":590,"y":2250,"width":520,"height":280,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"#60a5fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40201,"version":1,"versionNonce":40202,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"registry_events_text","x":615,"y":2270,"width":470,"height":240,"text":"C. IORegistry / IOHID 设备生命周期\n\nDeviceConnectionMonitor\nkIOFirstMatchNotification / kIOTerminatedNotification\n  -> 只重新计算 UI 连接徽标，不证明 HID++ 可写\n\nHIDMonitor\nIOHIDManager deviceMatching callback\n  -> 安装 raw callback + considerDevice()\n  -> takeoverRequested 时触发 REACQUIRE\n\nIOHIDManager deviceRemoval callback\n  -> removeDevice() + 清 route/verified axes\n  -> 有替代 transport 时切换，否则 UNAVAILABLE","originalText":"C. IORegistry / IOHID 设备生命周期\n\nDeviceConnectionMonitor\nkIOFirstMatchNotification / kIOTerminatedNotification\n  -> 只重新计算 UI 连接徽标，不证明 HID++ 可写\n\nHIDMonitor\nIOHIDManager deviceMatching callback\n  -> 安装 raw callback + considerDevice()\n  -> takeoverRequested 时触发 REACQUIRE\n\nIOHIDManager deviceRemoval callback\n  -> removeDevice() + 清 route/verified axes\n  -> 有替代 transport 时切换，否则 UNAVAILABLE","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#ffffff","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40203,"version":1,"versionNonce":40204,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"raw_events_group","x":590,"y":2570,"width":520,"height":330,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"#3b82f6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40205,"version":1,"versionNonce":40206,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"raw_events_text","x":615,"y":2590,"width":470,"height":290,"text":"D. IOHIDDevice raw-report callback\nLMHIDPPFilteredReportCallback\n\nreport 0x10 / sub-id 0x41 Receiver link event\n  connected -> channelReady + VERIFY / REACQUIRE\n  disconnected -> 清 route/verified axes + UNAVAILABLE\n\nreport 0x11 HID++ long report\n  精确响应 -> 唤醒 pending HID++ request\n  0x2121 主轮 -> 更新 route + 模型输出\n  0x2150 横向轮 -> 更新 route + 模型输出\n  battery notification -> 更新 UI\n\nreport 0x01 / 0x02 指针等高频报告\n  -> C bridge 丢弃，不进入 Swift","originalText":"D. IOHIDDevice raw-report callback\nLMHIDPPFilteredReportCallback\n\nreport 0x10 / sub-id 0x41 Receiver link event\n  connected -> channelReady + VERIFY / REACQUIRE\n  disconnected -> 清 route/verified axes + UNAVAILABLE\n\nreport 0x11 HID++ long report\n  精确响应 -> 唤醒 pending HID++ request\n  0x2121 主轮 -> 更新 route + 模型输出\n  0x2150 横向轮 -> 更新 route + 模型输出\n  battery notification -> 更新 UI\n\nreport 0x01 / 0x02 指针等高频报告\n  -> C bridge 丢弃，不进入 Swift","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#ffffff","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40207,"version":1,"versionNonce":40208,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"cg_events_group","x":1150,"y":2250,"width":500,"height":280,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40301,"version":1,"versionNonce":40302,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"cg_events_text","x":1175,"y":2270,"width":450,"height":240,"text":"E. CGEvent tap / 全局滚动事件\n\nscrollWheel\n  injected marker -> 直接放行，防反馈环\n  target HID++ correlation 命中 + verified axes\n    -> 抑制原生事件并放行模型输出\n  未验证 / 无相关性 -> fail-open，保留原生滚动\n\ntapDisabledByTimeout / tapDisabledByUserInput\n  -> 立即 CGEvent.tapEnable()，当前事件放行\n  -> 唤醒后若 tap 无效则重建\n\n注意：匿名原生 scroll 不能证明来自目标鼠标\n  -> 不直接触发 HID++ 恢复或槽位扫描","originalText":"E. CGEvent tap / 全局滚动事件\n\nscrollWheel\n  injected marker -> 直接放行，防反馈环\n  target HID++ correlation 命中 + verified axes\n    -> 抑制原生事件并放行模型输出\n  未验证 / 无相关性 -> fail-open，保留原生滚动\n\ntapDisabledByTimeout / tapDisabledByUserInput\n  -> 立即 CGEvent.tapEnable()，当前事件放行\n  -> 唤醒后若 tap 无效则重建\n\n注意：匿名原生 scroll 不能证明来自目标鼠标\n  -> 不直接触发 HID++ 恢复或槽位扫描","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40303,"version":1,"versionNonce":40304,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"arrow","id":"arrow_system_dispatch","x":550,"y":2390,"width":610,"height":610,"strokeColor":"#c2410c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40401,"version":1,"versionNonce":40402,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[25,0],[25,610],[610,610]],"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
    {"type":"arrow","id":"arrow_ui_dispatch","x":550,"y":2700,"width":610,"height":300,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40403,"version":1,"versionNonce":40404,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[25,0],[25,300],[610,300]],"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
